    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no \"new direction.\" there's just the decline. i look at my old work and it's like a ghost is haunting me. i'd honestly rather just stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke. to just walk away from it all and let the memory of what i was stay intact. wouldn't it be more dignified to just exit on a high note rather than slowly rot?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
